---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LeadForm from '../../components/LeadForm.astro';
import { STICKY_SHORTLIST } from '../../data/sticky-cta';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Get Your Gulf Property Shortlist: Free, One Business Day"
  description="Tell us your budget and target market across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, RAK, Qatar, Saudi and Bahrain. Free independent shortlist within one business day."
  stickyCta={STICKY_SHORTLIST}
>
  <section class="site-container py-12 md:py-16 max-w-2xl">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <h1 class="mb-3">Get your shortlist</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-muted)]">
        Share budget, market, and goal. We match you with vetted off-plan and ready options, no spam, no developer pressure.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)] mt-3">
        Independent research first. Enquiries are matched with licensed local partners, and we reply within one
        business day.
      </p>
    </header>
    <LeadForm
      title="Request your shortlist"
      subtitle="Licensed partner review · Dubai · Abu Dhabi · RAK"
      context="Get shortlist page"
    />
    <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)] mt-6">
      By submitting you agree to our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
      Not financial or legal advice.
    </p>
    <div class="prose mt-10">
      <p class="text-sm">
        Prefer to research first? Compare returns on the <a href="/gcc-rental-yields/">GCC rental yields hub</a>,
        plan a company move with <a href="/uae-business-setup-property/">UAE business setup to property</a>, or work
        through relocation admin in <a href="/uae-expat-documents-property/">expat paperwork to property</a>.
      </p>


    <div class="prose mt-10">
      <h2>What you get back</h2>
      <p>
        Within one business day, three to five options matched to your budget, horizon and objective. Each carries a price band, a net yield estimate rather than a gross one, the building-level service charge where it is published, a payment-plan summary if the unit is off-plan, and the specific checks we would want answered before a deposit moves.
      </p>
      <h2>What we need from you</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Budget range, and whether financing is part of the plan.</li>
        <li>Target market, or an instruction to compare several.</li>
        <li>Objective: income, capital growth, residency or personal use.</li>
        <li>Holding period, and whether the capital may be needed sooner.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>How this differs from a broker shortlist</h2>
      <p>
        Invest Gulf is an independent research publication. We take no listing fees from developers, so the shortlist is not ordered by commission and regularly includes the observation that a budget does not yet clear a threshold worth buying into. Where a purchase proceeds, enquiries are referred to RERA-licensed partners who handle the transaction itself.
      </p>
      <p>
        Useful background first: the <a href="/gcc-rental-yields/">GCC rental yields hub</a> for cross-market comparison, and <a href="/guides/cost-of-buying-property-dubai/">the real cost of buying in Dubai</a> for what sits on top of the price.
      </p>
    </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
